author=Axion SPSM
description=v3.7.8 fixes from the owner's v3.7.7 report: the parallel work is bounded (six packages at a time, two knobs at a time) so the load spike, the general slowness and the vanishing navigation bar are gone; Android's IPC plumbing (share resolver, permission controller, document picker, media provider) joined the never-suspend set, so "Restrict system apps too" can no longer break Share; the three doze state reads carry timeout lids. Suite: 586 checks, 0 failed.
